    "category": "classfeature",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Common with obsidian mirrors in Arcadia or bronze mirrors in Tian Xia, a handheld mirror is often used by sovereigns to keep themselves humble. A mirror inspires self-reflection and wisdom.</p><p><strong>Edicts</strong> Take measured action that weighs out the good and evil of any outcome.</p><p><strong>Anathema</strong> Allow yourself to become vain and stop serving your own people.</p><p><strong>Regalia's Gift</strong> While wielding your mirror, you have a +2 circumstance bonus to saves against mental effects and resistance equal to half your level to mental and spirit damage. You are immune to the stupefied and confused conditions.</p>"
